      "body": "Closes #43409\n\nThe edits endpoint declares `mask` for OpenAI API compatibility, but the\nmultimodal pipelines never consume a mask image, so an uploaded mask used to\nbe silently dropped and the caller got a successful response that looked as\nif the mask had been applied. Fail loudly with 501 Not Implemented instead.\n\nAdds a regression test under python/sglang/multimodal_gen/test/unit/.\n\nAI-assisted disclosure: root cause located and patch written with the help of\nan AI assistant; syntax, LF/BOM and the rejection logic verified locally\n(Windows cannot import sglang due to the Unix-only `resource` module, so the\nfull pytest run happens on CI).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38051361318](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38051361318)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38051361126](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38051361126)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38051361268](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38051361268)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
